  "name": "Mirrorwarfare",
  "tagline": "Mirror's Edge Catalyst parkour with Modern Warfare 2 guns: wallrun, vault and slide through a free-for-all against bots on MW2's own assets.",
  "how_to_play": [
    "Fight a free-for-all against 7 bots on the Parkour Playground with MW2 guns and Mirror's Edge parkour.",
    "Press Play to start straight in the arena with the bots.",
    "Hold W to run (speed builds over about 3 s), Space jumps, wallruns, wallclimbs, vaults and grabs ledges.",
    "C slides and rolls, Q turns 180 degrees; mouse fires, R reloads, V melee, F/G grenades.",
    "Type thirdperson in the console (~) to watch your body."
  ],
